c   513 full stringers + 104 peripheral fractions, 1140 equivalent channels,
c   five removable central 64.5-in stringers, and one sample-basket position
c - Haubenreich 1970 Table 1 matched comparison basis:
c   Haubenreich Table-1 U-233 operating salt ~= 65.04 LiF - 29.86 BeF2 - 4.98 ZrF4 - 0.13 UF4
c   density estimate at 1200 F ~= 135.87 lb/ft3 = 2.176 g/cm3
c   nominal fuel-salt reference TMP = 922.04 K (7.945516e-08 MeV)
c - Table 5.3 / text:
c   CGB graphite density ~ 1.87 g/cm3
