c   Haubenreich 1970 Table 1 comparison basis: 7.22 MW post-processing power,
c   Li-6/Li = 0.0048% after U-233 operation burnup, and fuel-salt direct tritium only.
c   Normal-operation route: retain the MSRE carrier salt and add U-233 as LiF-UF4 eutectic (73-27 mole %).
c   Carrier salt = 65-30-5 LiF-BeF2-ZrF4; target uranium concentration = 0.13 mole % for U-233 operations.
c   Be-9 -> Li-6 is a separately reportable replenishment channel and is not
c   part of the Haubenreich Table 1 direct Li-6 + Li-7 tritium benchmark.
c - Nuclear data selection:
c   library profile = endf80 (official Lib80x + ENDF80SaB2).
c   fuel/structure neutron tables use Lib80x .02c (900.0 K),
