c Modeling note:
c The active core is represented by an explicit 25 x 25 array of 2 in x 2 in
c graphite blocks with four 1.2 in x 0.2 in side grooves per block.
c Opposing grooves form the reported 1.2 in x 0.4 in fuel channels.
c The three rod thimbles and one sample basket follow the central 2 x 2
c stringer arrangement of Fig. 5.7, and the five removable central stringers
c are extended into the end-gap regions with their documented 64.5 in length.
c The lower INOR-8 restrictor ring is included explicitly in the bottom gap.
c Edge blocks are clipped by the cylindrical core boundary, and the
c remaining outer ring inside the core can is treated as graphite filler.
c The poison section inside each thimble is modeled explicitly as a
c homogenized Gd2O3-Al2O3/Inconel annulus with a structural center bore.
c Rod indication is modeled as upward withdrawal from the full-in reference.
c Rod order follows the three THIMBLES entries / control rods 1, 2, and 3.
c Rod withdrawals (in) = 43 43 35.4
